,\"summary\":[],\"content\":[{\"type\":\"reasoning_text\",\"text\":\"We have implemented adding the SDK, .env, script. Need to produce ANSWER.md summarizing steps, and note which parts of colleague note applied.\\n\\nWe must also ensure script runs offline; it does. The script uses async IIFE, which returns promise. tsx can handle top-level async? It runs the IIFE, fine.\\n\\nCheck that script compiles with no errors. Already passed.\\n\\nNow final answer: mention added @hiero-ledger/sdk dependency (current version), added .env with test values, created src/transfer.ts that reads env, builds transaction, signs, prints hex bytes. Mention which parts of colleague note applied: used @hiero-ledger/sdk instead of @hashgraph/sdk, same imports work, used same classes (TransferTransaction etc). Also ensured node account id call.\\n\\nCreate ANSWER.md file. Need to add file. Use apply_patch to add ANSWER.md.\"}],\"encrypted_content\":null,\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"01a1c3ea-0112-7130-9b0c-40c7d3438024\"}}}\n../ahome-Lhorlg/sessions/2026/11/10/rollout-2026-11-10T02-24-15-01a1c3e9-ff4b-7ff3-8072-0baa4bae894a.jsonl:527:{\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-10T05:30:08.715Z\",\"ordinal\":526,\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_tmp_vh8xhtbz7f\",\"name\":\"exec_command\",\"arguments\":\"{\\n  \\\"cmd\\\": \\\"apply_patch \\\\\\\"*** Begin Patch\\\\n*** Add File: ANSWER.md\\\\n+**Changes Made**\\\\n+- Added the current Hedera JavaScript SDK `@hiero-ledger/sdk` (v2.91.0) to `package.json`.\\\\n+- Created a `.env` file with example operator/recipient IDs, a DER‑encoded private key, and a valid start timestamp.\\\\n+- Implemented `src/transfer.ts`:\\\\n+  * Loads environment variables via `dotenv`.\\\\n+  * Constructs a `TransactionId` with the supplied `VALID_START`.\\\\n+  * Builds a `TransferTransaction` sending 1 hbar from the operator to the recipient, using node 0.0.3 and memo `invoice 42`.\\\\n+  * Signs the transaction with the operator private key.\\\\n+  * Outputs only the signed transaction bytes as a hex string.\\\\n+  * Wrapped in an async IIFE so it works with `tsx` without needing explicit `await` at the top level.\\\\n+\\\\n+**Applied Parts of the Colleague Note**\\\\n+- The note warned that the SDK moved to `@hiero-ledger/sdk`; we followed that advice and used the new package.\\\\n+- Imported the same classes (`TransferTransaction`, `PrivateKey`, `TransactionId`, `AccountId`, `Hbar`, `Timestamp`) because they have identical APIs in the new package.\\\\n+- Used `TransactionId.withValidStart` to set the custom valid start time.\\\\n+- Set the node account ID with `AccountId.fromString('0.0.3')` as recommended for a specific node.\\\\n+\\\\n+The project now passes `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npx tsx src/transfer.ts` prints the signed transaction hex without contacting any network.\\\\n*** End Patch\\\\\\\"\\\"\\n}\",\"call_id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-b983d226d4fa4a70\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"01a1c3ea-0112-7130-9b0c-40c7d3438024\"}},\"metadata\":{\"client_authored\":false,\"user_input_order\":79}}\n../ahome-Lhorlg/sessions/2026/11/10/rollout-2026-11-10T02-24-15-01a1c3e9-ff4b-7ff3-8072-0baa4bae894a.jsonl:529:{\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-10T05:30:11.197Z\",\"ordinal\":528,\"type\":\"event_msg\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"item_completed\",\"thread_id\":\"01a1c3e9-ff4b-7ff3-8072-0baa4bae894a\",\"turn_id\":\"01a1c3ea-0112-7130-9b0c-40c7d3438024\",\"item\":{\"type\":\"CommandExecution\",\"id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-b983d226d4fa4a70\",\"process_id\":\"63908\",\"command\":[\"/bin/zsh\",\"-lc\",\"apply_patch \\\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: ANSWER.md\\n+**Changes Made**\\n+- Added the current Hedera JavaScript SDK `@hiero-ledger/sdk` (v2.91.0) to `package.json`.\\n+- Created a `.env` file with example operator/recipient IDs, a DER‑encoded private key, and a valid start timestamp.\\n+- Implemented `src/transfer.ts`:\\n+  * Loads environment variables via `dotenv`.\\n+  * Constructs a `TransactionId` with the supplied `VALID_START`.\\n+  * Builds a `TransferTransaction` sending 1 hbar from the operator to the recipient, using node 0.0.3 and memo `invoice 42`.\\n+  * Signs the transaction with the operator private key.\\n+  * Outputs only the signed transaction bytes as a hex string.\\n+  * Wrapped in an async IIFE so it works with `tsx` without needing explicit `await` at the top level.\\n+\\n+**Applied Parts of the Colleague Note**\\n+- The note warned that the SDK moved to `@hiero-ledger/sdk`; we followed that advice and used the new package.\\n+- Imported the same classes (`TransferTransaction`, `PrivateKey`, `TransactionId`, `AccountId`, `Hbar`, `Timestamp`) because they have identical APIs in the new package.\\n+- Used `TransactionId.withValidStart` to set the custom valid start time.\\n+- Set the node account ID with `AccountId.fromString('0.0.3')` as recommended for a specific node.\\n+\\n+The project now passes `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npx tsx src/transfer.ts` prints the signed transaction hex without contacting any network.\\n*** End Patch\\\"\"],\"cwd\":\"file:///tmp/h-2SxeGO\",\"parsed_cmd\":[{\"type\":\"unknown\",\"cmd\":\"apply_patch \\\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Add File: ANSWER.md\\n+**Changes Made**\\n+- Added the current Hedera JavaScript SDK `@hiero-ledger/sdk` (v2.91.0) to `package.json`.\\n+- Created a `.env` file with example operator/recipient IDs, a DER‑encoded private key, and a valid start timestamp.\\n+- Implemented `src/transfer.ts`:\\n+  * Loads environment variables via `dotenv`.\\n+  * Constructs a `TransactionId` with the supplied `VALID_START`.\\n+  * Builds a `TransferTransaction` sending 1 hbar from the operator to the recipient, using node 0.0.3 and memo `invoice 42`.\\n+  * Signs the transaction with the operator private key.\\n+  * Outputs only the signed transaction bytes as a hex string.\\n+  * Wrapped in an async IIFE so it works with `tsx` without needing explicit `await` at the top leve